From 5815108824052a631c545c14f9d4228fb4a69df6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pypto-x-agent <agent@pypto-x.local>
Date: Sun, 13 Sep 2026 01:12:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 255/258] feat(execution): report schema v4 embeds the plan
 payload preimage

Close the last plan-payload residual (verify-0043/f0258e32 R3) by embedding
the canonical plan payload in the report:

* new required top-level block plan_payload = {digest, document}; the digest
  is recomputed from the embedded body with canonical JSON, and
  resolution.plan_digest must equal it, so plan_digest is derived from the
  embedded document instead of being a free copy;
* resolution_decision.document must equal the deterministic projection of
  the embedded payload (new leaf module pypto.execution.decision, shared by
  the report builder and the validator); a decision-body rewrite (including
  the round-2 R5 selected_threads/selected_thread_mode residual) is refused
  unless the payload itself is rewritten;
* REPORT_SCHEMA_VERSION 3 -> 4: only v4 is accepted, v3 and older are
  rejected with report_schema_version_legacy_rejected (frozen v3 genuine
  reports included), >4 keeps report_schema_version_mismatch; v3 semantics
  are not silently reinterpreted;
* the fully coordinated alternate payload (payload + digests + re-derived
  decision + all report copies) remains accepted and is registered together
  with the whole-registered-identity substitution as the no-attestation
  residual; no signature/attestation is added;
* all 0042/0043 anchors and the R1-R5 partial reconciliations are kept; the
  audit and tests cover plan_payload single-copy/body/digest/coordinated
  tampers, missing block, wrong types, the v3 migration gate and the
  coherent-alternate-payload residual; the v3 test file is renamed to
  test_execution_report_manifest_v31.py;
* docs: 0006 section 3.2/7.1 and the brief move the plan-payload class from
  'not embedded' to the no-attestation residual and record v4 semantics.
